             <div class="text-dark scroll-text  mb-0" style="display:inline-block; white-space:nowrap; animation: scroll-left 26s linear infinite;">
                 <!--Welcome to the Agri Infra Portal — Empowering farmers with infrastructure support under the Agriculture Infrastructure Fund.-->
                 
                 The Agriculture Infrastructure Fund (AIF) Scheme permits convergence with various Central and State Government schemes, including MIDH, PMFME, SMAM, GOBAR-Dhan, PMKSY, AMI, PACS as MSC, RKVY, PMEGP, and PM-KUSUM (Components A, B & C), for selected eligible projects/assets and beneficiaries as per the AIF Scheme Guidelines.
             </div>
 </div>
